OL,3,GNEWSASteam train water tower
OL,4,Arestoration back on track
OL,5,
OL,6,FA metal water tower thought to be more
OL,7,Fthan 100 years old that was used to
OL,8,Freplenish steam locomotives is to be
OL,9,Frestored by a team of enthusiasts.
OL,11,FMembers of Northampton & Lamport
OL,12,FRailway have taken delivery from
OL,13,FNetwork Rail of the "parachute-style"
OL,14,Fwater tower that used to stand at
OL,15,FNorthampton railway station.
OL,17,FAfter securing a #30,000 grant from the
OL,18,FRailway Heritage Trust, the charity
OL,19,Fsaid it would be restored over several
OL,20,Fmonths and installed at Boughton, just
OL,21,Fa few miles from its original home.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
